Test data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

tests/data/encoder-vectors.jsonl, encoder-vectors-extra.jsonl and
encoder-vectors-random.jsonl were generated from WSJT-X 3.0.0-rc1 `ft8sim`
output: for each input message, the payload bits, channel symbols and
message text that program printed. They are used only as black-box
reference values.
